  "source_conflicts_and_limits": [
    "GPPVA_TW outer provider is conflicting: live CompOSE page 212 says BPS, the directly linked official PDF says BSk22. Keep this model BLOCKED_COMPONENT_ADMISSION.",
    "GPPVA_FSU2R official page 203 states BSk22, but its direct PDF link returned 404; provider claim is page-backed and its phase legend is corroborated by the GPPVA sheet family and observed source fields.",
    "GM1 live page and Git source agree on 349 points, while the linked 2014 PDF says247; preserve the PDF discrepancy as stale/inconsistent metadata.",
    "APR and BBB source grid support has a gap after row69; no interpolation or synthetic matching point is inserted.",
    "The ZIP archive SHA-256 is historical delivery-manifest evidence and was not independently rehashed from downloaded archive bytes in this turn."
  ],
  "decisions": [
    "Use exact source-row and model-local phase dictionaries; no generic density fallback.",
    "APR_APR and BBB_BHF2: exclude source rows1-69 (BPS+SLy4 crust) from core-only construction and retain rows70 onward; preserve each model's different first core density.",
    "GM_GM1: retain rows49 onward for core-only construction based on page statement and composition support; cutoff 1e-3 lies between sampled rows48/49.",
    "RG_KDE0v1: Iphase4 is clusterized/heavy-nucleus matter; Iphase3 is homogeneous core; select rows967 onward.",
    "RG_SLY4: apply its own Iphase dictionary; select rows144 onward.",
    "SPG and GPPVA crust tables contain rows1-217 BSk22 outer-crust support, with neutron drip at the row217/218 boundary near2.69e-4 fm^-3; source provider splice below2e-3 is a distinct transition.",
    "Do not infer neutron drip from Iphase=7 or from the 2e-3 outer-provider splice.",
    "GPPVA eos.thermo q_extra geometry is categorical and distinct from eos.compo Iphase; preserve without numeric interpolation.",
    "GPPVA_TW remains blocked until BPS-versus-BSk22 provider discrepancy is resolved."
  ],
